All code in this crate was written from the format specifications; no code
was copied or ported from other implementations. Besides the standards below,
the TIFF 6.0 specification (Adobe) with the BigTIFF extension, the PNG and APNG
specifications, the GIF89a specification and the WebP container specification
were used; they contributed no code or tables. Constant tables taken from
specifications:

* RFC 1950 / RFC 1951 (zlib / deflate): length and distance code tables.
* ITU-T T.81 (JPEG), Annex K: example quantization and Huffman tables used by
  the encoder; zigzag order.
* RFC 6386 (VP8 Data Format and Decoding Guide): src/webp/vp8_tables.rs
  (kf_bmode_prob, coeff_update_probs, default_coeff_probs, dc_qlookup,
  ac_qlookup) and the small trees / constants in src/webp/vp8.rs were
  extracted from the RFC text. RFC 6386 code components are provided under
  the BSD license by the IETF Trust and the authors:
