* RFC 9649 (WebP Image Format): VP8L distance map table and code length
  code order.

* AV1 Bitstream & Decoding Process Specification (Alliance for Open Media):
  src/av1/cdf_tables.rs, scan_tables.rs, qm_tables.rs and tables.rs are
  extracted from the specification text by tools/av1_tables.py (the
  quantizer matrices as their fundamental 32x32 and 32x16 matrices, from
  which the decoder derives the other sizes as the specification
  describes). The decoder in src/av1 follows the specification's decoding
  process; no code of libaom, dav1d or other AV1 implementations was used.
  AV1 is covered by the Alliance for Open Media Patent License 1.0, see
  PATENTS-AV1.md.
* ISO/IEC 23008-12 (HEIF) and the AV1 Image File Format (AVIF) for the
  container in src/heif.rs; they contributed no code or tables.

Algorithms (not code) referenced: Arai-Agui-Nakajima scaled DCT, the
"fancy" triangle chroma upsampling with the rounding used by the Independent
JPEG Group's libjpeg, package-merge (Larmore-Hirschberg) for length-limited
Huffman codes.
